[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0010","text":"啊呜……\n肚子饿了，回不了家……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0020","text":"厨房里应该还有点零食……\n甜花酱，要吃吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0030","text":"…………\n那个零食，已经吃掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0040","text":"这、这样啊……！\n那找找别的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0050","text":"甜花，没电了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0060","text":"甜花酱，我去便利店买点东西\n你在这等────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0070","text":"……！\n这个声音……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0080","text":"烤红薯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0090","text":"哈呼……\n……好幸福……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500400_04_0100","text":"甜花，复活……！"}]
